  "contentHtml": "<div><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\">불로그에 정리한 글 그대로 가져와 말이 좀 짧습니다^^</span></font></div><div><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><br></span></font></div><div><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\">--------------</span></font></div><div><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><br></span></font></div><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">별&nbsp;거&nbsp;아니지만&nbsp;이렇게&nbsp;틀&nbsp;인쇄해놓고&nbsp;조금씩&nbsp;적어가며&nbsp;수업준비하면&nbsp;좋을&nbsp;것&nbsp;같고,&nbsp;다음에&nbsp;기억날&nbsp;듯&nbsp;해서&nbsp;만들었다.<br>특히&nbsp;협업,&nbsp;피드백,&nbsp;지식구조화등&nbsp;을&nbsp;놓치고&nbsp;넘어가는&nbsp;듯&nbsp;해서&nbsp;요게&nbsp;포인트!&nbsp;</span></font><div><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></font></div><div><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">개학하고&nbsp;첫&nbsp;수업은&nbsp;아래처럼&nbsp;디자인했다.&nbsp;<br>음..&nbsp;나만의&nbsp;스타일이&nbsp;정리되어가는&nbsp;것&nbsp;같긴한데&nbsp;머리&nbsp;쥐날&nbsp;지경&nbsp;ㅎㅎ<br></span></font></div><div><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></font></div><div><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">1학기에&nbsp;늘&nbsp;들여다보며&nbsp;고민하던&nbsp;진도표의&nbsp;비중이&nbsp;줄어들&nbsp;것&nbsp;같다.&nbsp;ㅎ&nbsp;<br>진도표가&nbsp;수업재산&nbsp;1호였는데..<br></span></font></div><p><img src='https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/263DF94353F1491213' class='txc-image' /></p><p><img src='https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/220C2C4653F1491330' class='txc-image' /></p><p><img src='https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/2337374553F1491313' class='txc-image' /></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
